  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Xmas Curtain** (1 other source): Recorder lost battery power for about ten seconds around 2:27 into this track [1]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **My_Morning_Jacket_High_Sierra_Music_Festival_Main_Stage_2006-07-01** (recommended): source not stated; 20 songs; 116 min; rated 5/5 by 1 [1]. Said about its sound: Main stage recording has great sound and a beautiful mix, with lush lighting and an airy, gorgeous night atmosphere [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Reviewer saw the previous night's 6-30 late show in a cramped, oversold barn with perhaps 500-600 people, cold mountain air [2]\n- Compared with the packed late-night barn show with poor acoustics, the main stage set drew roughly 3000-5000 people [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **My_Morning_Jacket_High_Sierra_Music_Festival_Main_Stage_2006-07-01**: taped by tfs8271; transferred by tfs8271; source: Neumann km140s>ACM Marantz PMD660 [1]. Also: Recorded with Neumann km140s through Oade ACM into a Marantz PMD 660; transferred via Sound Forge 7.0 to FLAC [1]",
